WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.288 --> 00:00:12.744
If you're self-conscious about a scar or burn mark, advanced cover makeup using special-effects techniques can conceal it well.

2
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:25.320
Going beyond ordinary makeup, we use special materials and techniques suited to the scar's color, texture, and depth to balance both sides of the face and recreate smooth skin.

3
00:00:25.656 --> 00:00:35.208
Since scarred, delicate skin can make foundation sit unevenly with ordinary application, precise blending skills are essential.

4
00:00:35.544 --> 00:00:43.752
Because preparation matters so much for scar coverage, be sure to get your skin checked in a one-on-one consultation beforehand,

5
00:00:44.088 --> 00:00:51.696
so a customized product and plan can be prepared to turn any anxiety into confidence on the day.

6
00:00:52.032 --> 00:01:03.960
Look for shops that specialize in scar and burn coverage — search terms like "scar makeup" or "scar concealing" — and prepare through a consultation in advance.
